  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">NTA ICAR AIEEA PG Ph.D Answer Key 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-10T16:48:22+05:30\">August 10, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">4:48 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/ICAR/\">National Testing Agency (NTA)</a>\u00a0</strong>will release <strong>the answer key</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>Indian Council of Agricultural Research (ICAR) AIEEA PG and Ph.D. Admission 2026.</strong> The\u00a0<strong>exam</strong> was conducted on <strong data-end=\"366\" data-start=\"338\">04 July 2026</strong>. and the\u00a0<strong>last date</strong>\u00a0to submit the application form was<strong> 07 June 2026.</strong>\u00a0Candidates can also check their\u00a0<strong>Answer Key</strong>\u00a0by using their\u00a0<strong>Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the\u00a0<strong>portal.\u00a0The\u00a0direct link</strong>\u00a0is provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoratio